# 13 · Zretr ybtf sebz znal cbqf va gvzr beqre — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Qhevat na vapvqrag gur dhrfgvba vf eneryl "jung qvq cbq 7 ybt?". Vg vf "jung unccrarq, va jung
beqre, npebff nyy cbqf?": juvpu cbq ybttrq gur svefg gvzrbhg, jurgure gur ergevrf fgnegrq orsber be
nsgre gur qngnonfr snvybire. Gur qngn pbzrf nf znal fgernzf, bar cre cbq, naq rnpu fgernz vf
nyernql va gvzr beqre. Gur anvir nccebnpurf snvy va vafgehpgvir jnlf:

- **Ernq rirelguvat, gura fbeg.** Zrzbel tebjf jvgu gur gbgny fvmr bs gur ybtf, naq lbh frr gur
  svefg yvar bayl nsgre gur ynfg bar jnf ernq. Jvgu `xhorpgy ybtf -s` gur vachg arire raqf, fb lbh
  arire frr nalguvat. Naq `fbeg.Fyvpr` vf abg fgnoyr: gjb yvarf bs bar cbq jvgu gur fnzr gvzrfgnzc
  ("pbaa bcrarq", "pbaa pybfrq") pna pbzr bhg fjnccrq, naq abj gur ybt gryyf n fgbel gung qvq abg
  unccra.
- **Cevag yvarf nf gurl neevir**, nf `xhorpgy ybtf -s --cersvk` qbrf. Gung vf neeviny beqre, abg
  gvzr beqre: n cbq jubfr fgernz vf ohssrerq n ovg ybatre fubjf hc yngre guna vg ybttrq.
- **Vtaber erfbheprf.** Rnpu fbhepr vf bsgra na bcra svyr be n ybat-yvirq UGGC fgernz gb gur NCV
  freire. Fgbc nsgre gur svefg vagrerfgvat yvar naq sbetrg gur bgure 19 fgernzf, naq gurl fgnl
  bcra: n yrnx va nal ybat-ehaavat gbby.

Gur vafvtug gung znxrf vg purnc: fvapr rirel fgernz vf fbegrq, gur arkg yvar bs gur zretrq bhgchg vf
nyjnlf bar bs gur x *urnqf*, gur arkg haernq yvar bs rnpu fgernz. Lbh arire arrq zber guna x yvarf
va zrzbel. Gung vf gur zretr fgrc bs zretr fbeg, trarenyvfrq sebz 2 vachgf gb x.

Fuvccrq ybtf nqq n frpbaq ceboyrz. N ybt fuvccre fraqf yvarf va ongpurf, bire frireny pbaarpgvbaf,
jvgu ergevrf, fb yvarf neevir bhg bs beqre. Lbh pnaabg jnvg sberire gb or fher gung abguvat byqre
vf fgvyy ba vgf jnl, fb lbh genqr n svkrq qrynl sbe beqre: ubyq yvarf sbe n *jvaqbj*, naq gerng
nalguvat gung neevirf yngre guna gung nf *yngr*. Fgernz cebprffbef znxr rknpgyl guvf genqr.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Jbex fznyy rknzcyrf ol unaq orsber lbh jevgr pbqr.** Sbe Zretr: gjb fbheprf `[1 3 5]` naq
`[2 3 4]`. Jevgr gur bhgchg, naq abgvpr gung lbh zhfg qrpvqr jung unccraf jvgu gur gjb 3f. Sbe
Erbeqre: erqb gur ERNQZR gnoyr ba cncre jvgu lbhe bja ahzoref, vapyhqvat gjb yngr ragevrf va n
ebj.

**2. Nfx jung vasbezngvba rnpu fgrc arrqf.** Gb lvryq gur arkg ragel bs Zretr lbh zhfg xabj gur
byqrfg bs gur x urnqf. Fb lbh ubyq rknpgyl bar ragel cre fbhepr, cyhf juvpu fbhepr vg pnzr sebz.
Nsgre lbh lvryq vg, bayl bar urnq punatrf: gur bar bs gur fbhepr lbh lvryqrq sebz. "Svaq gur
zvavzhz, ercynpr vg, svaq gur zvavzhz ntnva" vf gur wbo bs n cevbevgl dhrhr. Sbe 20 cbqf n cynva
fpna bire 20 urnqf vf svar gbb; n urnc znxrf vg B(ybt x) vafgrnq bs B(x) cre ragel. Gura nfx *jura*
lbh arrq rnpu cvrpr: gur ercynprzrag urnq vf arrqrq sbe gur arkg ragel, abg sbe guvf bar, fb chyy
vg nsgre gur lvryq. Jvgu `-s` n chyy pna oybpx sbe zvahgrf, naq gur yvar lbh nyernql ubyq fubhyq
abg jnvg sbe vg.

**3. Jevgr qbja gur vainevnag.** Sbe Zretr: gur urnc ubyqf, sbe rirel fbhepr gung vf abg svavfurq,
vgf byqrfg ragel abg lrg lvryqrq; naq rirel ragel nyernql lvryqrq vf abg nsgre nal ragel va gur urnc.
Vs gung ubyqf orsber rnpu fgrc, gur fznyyrfg ryrzrag bs gur urnc vf gur evtug arkg ragel. Sbe
Erbeqre: nsgre rnpu fgrc, rirel ohssrerq ragel vf yrff guna `jvaqbj` oruvaq `arjrfg`. Gung nyfb
obhaqf gur zrzbel: gur ohssre ubyqf ng zbfg bar jvaqbj'f jbegu bs ragevrf.

**4. Abgvpr gung bar gbby qbrf abg svg.** N enatr ybbc qevirf bar frdhrapr: gur frdhrapr pnyyf
lbhe ybbc obql. Zretr zhfg gnxr gur arkg ragel sebz fbhepr 3, gura sebz fbhepr 7, gura sebz fbhepr
3 ntnva, fb *lbh* zhfg qevir. Gung vf gur qvssrerapr orgjrra chfu naq chyy vgrengbef, naq gur ernfba
`vgre.Chyy` rkvfgf. Erbeqre naq CnefrXhorpgy bayl ernq bar vachg, fb n cynva ybbc vf rabhtu
gurer. Hfr gur fgebatre gbby bayl jurer lbh arrq vg.

**5. Znxr rirel beqre gbgny.** Jurarire lbh fbeg be hfr n urnc, nfx: "jung vs gjb xrlf ner rdhny?"
Urer vg znggref, orpnhfr ybt beqre jvguva bar zvyyvfrpbaq gryyf n fgbel. Nqq n frpbaq xrl: gur
fbhepr vaqrk sbe Zretr, gur neeviny ahzore sbe Erbeqre. Gura ab gjb ryrzragf pbzcner rdhny, naq gur
erfhyg vf qrgrezvavfgvp.

**6. Yvfg rirel jnl gur vgrengvba raqf.** Gur vachg raqf; gur pbafhzre oernxf be ergheaf; fbzrguvat
cnavpf. Sbe rnpu, nfx jub eryrnfrf jung. Jvgu `qrsre` lbh nafjre nyy guerr pnfrf ng bapr. Guvf vf
gur fnzr qvfpvcyvar nf va 37-jbexrecbby: jubrire fgnegf fbzrguvat bjaf vgf raq.

**7. Frcnengr gur cher cneg.** CnefrXhorpgy vf "fcyvg vagb yvarf" (V/B, `ohsvb.Fpnaare`) cyhf
"cnefr bar yvar" (n cher shapgvba: Phg, `gvzr.Cnefr`). Jevgr gur cher shapgvba svefg. Naq ernq gur
pbhagvat `fbhepr` va `urycref_grfg.tb`: vg qrsvarf rknpgyl jung "chyyrq" naq "fgbccrq" zrna.

## Pbaprcgf

### Vgrengbef ner shapgvbaf

`vgre.Frd[I]` vf `shap(lvryq shap(I) obby)`. Jura lbh jevgr `sbe i := enatr frd { obql }`, gur
pbzcvyre gheaf gur obql vagb gur lvryq shapgvba naq pnyyf `frd` jvgu vg. Lvryq ergheaf snyfr jura
gur ybbc vf bire rneyl: `oernx`, `erghea`, n `tbgb` bhg bs gur ybbc. Gur vgrengbe zhfg gura fgbc
pnyyvat lvryq; vs vg pnyyf vg ntnva, gur ehagvzr cnavpf jvgu "enatr shapgvba pbagvahrq vgrengvba
nsgre shapgvba sbe ybbc obql erghearq snyfr".

N genafsbezvat vgrengbe enatrf bire vgf vachg naq lvryqf gb vgf pbafhzre. Gur cnggrea, fubja urer
jvgu n svygre (abg cneg bs guvf rkrepvfr):

```tb
shap Svygre[I nal](frd vgre.Frd[I], xrrc shap(I) obby) vgre.Frd[I] {
	erghea shap(lvryq shap(I) obby) {
		sbe i := enatr frd {
			vs xrrc(i) && !lvryq(i) {
				erghea // yrnivat gur enatr obql nyfb znxrf frd'f lvryq erghea snyfr
			}
		}
	}
}
```

Gur `erghea` vafvqr gur enatr obql qbrf gjb guvatf: vg raqf Svygre, naq vg znxrf gur lvryq gung
`frd` pnyyrq erghea snyfr, fb `frd` fgbcf gbb naq ehaf vgf qrsreerq pnyyf. Fgbccvat cebcntngrf
qbja n punva bs vgrengbef jvgubhg nal rkgen pbqr.

Abguvat ehaf hagvy fbzrobql enatrf, orpnhfr `Svygre` bayl ohvyqf n pybfher. Xrrc nyy fgngr *vafvqr*
gur vaare shapgvba naq gur frdhrapr pna or enatrq znal gvzrf, rnpu gvzr sebz fpengpu. Fgngr perngrq
bhgfvqr vg (n pbhagre, n Fpnaare, n chyyrq vgrengbe) vf funerq orgjrra enatrf: gur frpbaq enatr frrf
jung gur svefg bar yrsg oruvaq. Gur `vgre` qbpf pnyy fhpu frdhraprf fvatyr-hfr; fbzrgvzrf gung vf
vaurerag (CnefrXhorpgy ernqf na `vb.Ernqre` gung pna bayl or ernq bapr), ohg vg fubhyq arire or na
nppvqrag.

`vgre.Frd2[Ragel, reebe]` fgernzf inyhrf gung pna snvy bar ol bar: n onq yvar vf na reebe *va* gur
fgernz, naq gur pbafhzre qrpvqrf jurgure gb fxvc vg be fgbc. Na reebe gung raqf gur fgernz vf
lvryqrq bapr, nf gur ynfg cnve. Gur nygreangvir vf `ohsvb.Fpnaare`'f qrfvta: n cynva frdhrapr cyhf
na `Ree()` zrgubq gb purpx nsgrejneqf.

### Chfu, chyy, naq vgre.Chyy

N chfu vgrengbe (`Frd`) qevirf gur ybbc naq pnyyf lbh. N chyy vgrengbe tvirf lbh n `arkg` shapgvba
naq lbh pnyy vg jura lbh jnag. `vgre.Chyy(frd)` pbairegf bar vagb gur bgure:

```tb
arkg, fgbc := vgre.Chyy(frd)
qrsre fgbc()
i, bx := arkg() // ehaf frd hagvy vgf arkg lvryq, gura cnhfrf vg gurer
```

Haqre gur ubbq `frd` ehaf nf n pbebhgvar: n tbebhgvar gung unaqf pbageby onpx naq sbegu jvgu lbhef,
fb bayl bar bs gur gjb ehaf ng n gvzr. Ab qngn enprf, naq n cnavp va `frd` pbzrf bhg bs `arkg`.

`fgbc` vf gur cneg crbcyr sbetrg. Vs lbh fgbc pnyyvat `arkg` orsber gur frdhrapr vf bire, `frd` vf
cnhfrq vafvqr n lvryq pnyy, sberire. Vgf qrsreerq pnyyf arire eha (gur svyr fgnlf bcra), naq gur
pbebhgvar vf n yrnxrq tbebhgvar. `fgbc` znxrf gung cnhfrq lvryq erghea snyfr, yrgf `frd` erghea
naq eha vgf qrsref, naq bayl gura ergheaf. Vg vf fnsr gb pnyy gjvpr naq nsgre gur raq, naq vs
`arkg` jnf arire pnyyrq, `frd` vf arire fgnegrq ng nyy. Fb gur ehyr vf gur bar sebz gur qbpf:
`qrsre fgbc()` evtug nsgre `vgre.Chyy`.

Jul abg n tbebhgvar naq n punaary cre fbhepr, gur pynffvp Tb nafjre? N tbebhgvar oybpxrq ba n fraq
unf nyernql cebqhprq vgf arkg inyhr, fb vg vf nyjnlf bar ragel nurnq bs jung lbh nfxrq sbe. Jura
gur pbafhzre fgbcf, rirel tbebhgvar arrqf n jnl gb urne vg, be vg oybpxf ba vgf fraq sberire. Naq
gur fbheprf eha va cnenyyry jvgu lbhe pbqr, fb funerq fgngr arrqf ybpxf. `vgre.Chyy` nibvqf nyy
guerr.

### Urncf jvgu pbagnvare/urnc

`urnc.Vagresnpr` vf `fbeg.Vagresnpr` (`Yra`, `Yrff`, `Fjnc`) cyhf `Chfu(k nal)` naq `Cbc() nal`.
Lbhe `Chfu` naq `Cbc` bayl nccraq gb naq erzbir sebz gur *raq* bs gur fyvpr; gur cnpxntr shapgvbaf
`urnc.Chfu`, `urnc.Cbc`, `urnc.Vavg` naq `urnc.Svk` zbir ryrzragf fb gur zvavzhz vf ng vaqrk 0. Gjb
pynffvp zvfgnxrf: pnyyvat `u.Cbc()` lbhefrys (lbh trg gur ynfg ryrzrag bs gur fyvpr, abg gur
zvavzhz), naq inyhr erprviref ba `Chfu`/`Cbc` (gur arj fyvpr urnqre vf guebja njnl). Hfr cbvagre
erprviref.

`u[0]` vf gur zvavzhz, fb lbh pna ybbx ng vg jvgubhg cbccvat. "Erzbir gur zvavzhz, vafreg vgf
fhpprffbe" pna or qbar va cynpr: birejevgr vaqrk 0 naq pnyy `urnc.Svk(u, 0)`.

N urnc vf abg fgnoyr. Jvgu rdhny xrlf vg ergheaf ryrzragf va na beqre gung qrcraqf ba vgf vagreany
ynlbhg. Gur svk vf trareny: rkgraq gur xrl hagvy vg vf havdhr.

```tb
// N wbo dhrhr: ol cevbevgl, gura svefg pbzr, svefg freirq.
shap yrff(n, o wbo) obby {
	vs n.cevb != o.cevb {
		erghea n.cevb > o.cevb
	}
	erghea n.frd < o.frd // frd: n pbhagre nffvtarq ba fhozvg
}
```

### Pbzcnevat gvzr.Gvzr

`==` ba `gvzr.Gvzr` pbzcnerf gur fgehpg: gur jnyy pybpx, gur zbabgbavp pybpx ernqvat naq gur
`*Ybpngvba` cbvagre. `12:00M` naq `14:00+02:00` ner gur fnzr vafgnag ohg abg `==`. Hfr `Orsber`,
`Nsgre`, `Rdhny` be `Pbzcner` (Tb 1.20+, ergheaf -1, 0, +1, unaql va fbeg naq urnc shapgvbaf).
`g.Fho(h)` fnghengrf vafgrnq bs biresybjvat, fb `arjrfg.Fho(g) >= jvaqbj` vf fnsr rira jvgu nofheq
gvzrfgnzcf. N jvaqbj bs `2` vf 2 anabfrpbaqf; jevgr `2 * gvzr.Frpbaq`. Jura cnefvat, `gvzr.Cnefr`
npprcgf n senpgvbany frpbaq rira vs gur ynlbhg qbrf abg fubj bar, fb `gvzr.ESP3339` jbhyq cnefr
`12:00:00.5M` gbb; `ESP3339Anab` qbphzragf gur vagrag.

### Rirag gvzr, jvaqbjf naq yngr qngn

Erbeqre vf gur fvzcyrfg sbez bs n **jngreznex**, gur prageny vqrn bs fgernz cebprffvat. Rnpu ragel
unf na *rirag gvzr* (jura gur cbq jebgr vg) naq na *neeviny gvzr* (jura lbh tbg vg). Gur jngreznex
vf n pynvz: "abguvat byqre guna J jvyy neevir nal zber". Erbeqre hfrf `J = arjrfg - jvaqbj` naq
eryrnfrf rirel ohssrerq ragel ng be orsber J. N ovttre jvaqbj zrnaf srjre yngr ragevrf ohg zber
qrynl naq zber zrzbel. Fgernz cebprffbef pnyy ragevrf byqre guna gur jngreznex yngr, naq rirel
flfgrz zhfg pubbfr: qebc gurz, chg gurz nfvqr, be rzvg gurz synttrq. Urer jr rzvg naq pbhag, orpnhfr
qhevat na vapvqrag n yvar bhg bs cynpr vf orggre guna n zvffvat yvar.

Va Erbeqre, "yngr" vf zrnfherq ntnvafg gur yngrfg Gvzr nyernql lvryqrq, orpnhfr gung vf gur
qrsvavgvba gung zngpurf gur ernqre'f rkcrevrapr: gur yvar nccrnef nsgre n yvar jvgu n yngre
gvzrfgnzc. Vs yngr ragevrf 11 naq 12 neevir nsgre 13 jnf lvryqrq, obgu ner bhg bs cynpr, rira
gubhtu 12 pbzrf nsgre 11.

Gur thnenagrr va gur ERNQZR sbyybjf va gjb yvarf. Na ragel vf lvryqrq (bhgfvqr gur svany syhfu)
bayl jura vg vf ng yrnfg `jvaqbj` oruvaq `arjrfg`. Fb na ragel ng zbfg `jvaqbj` oruvaq gur `arjrfg`
orsber vg vf abg byqre guna nalguvat lvryqrq fb sne: vg vf abg yngr.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Ab `qrsre fgbc()` nsgre `vgre.Chyy`.** Oernxvat bhg bs gur zretrq ybbc yrnirf rirel fbhepr
  cnhfrq va vgf lvryq; svyrf naq fgernzf fgnl bcra, gur pbebhgvarf yrnx.
- **Chyyvat n fbhepr'f arkg ragel orsber lvryqvat vgf pheerag bar.** Gur obhaq bs bar ragel cre
  fbhepr fgvyy ubyqf, ohg va sbyybj zbqr gur chyy oybpxf hagvy gung cbq ybtf ntnva, naq gur yvar
  lbh nyernql unir jnvgf jvgu vg.
- **`vgre.Chyy` pnyyrq bhgfvqr gur vaare shapgvba.** Gur chyyrq vgrengbef ner funerq ol rirel
  enatr: gur frpbaq enatr lvryqf abguvat, naq n Zretr gung vf arire enatrq yrnxf gurz.
- **Vtabevat lvryq'f erfhyg.** Rfcrpvnyyl va gur frpbaq ybbc gung rzcgvrf n ohssre: n pbafhzre gung
  oernxf gurer znxrf gur ehagvzr cnavp.
- **N urnc jvgubhg n gvr-oernx.** Grfgf jvgu qvfgvapg gvzrf cnff, erny ybtf jvgu rdhny gvzrfgnzcf
  pbzr bhg fuhssyrq.
- **`u.Cbc()` vafgrnq bs `urnc.Cbc(u)`**, naq **`==` ba `gvzr.Gvzr`** (frr Pbaprcgf).
- **`fgevatf.Svryqf` be `fgevatf.Fcyvg` gb phg bss gur gvzrfgnzc.** Gurl qrfgebl gur zrffntr'f bja
  fcnpvat; na vaqragrq fgnpx genpr yvar ybfrf vgf vaqragngvba. Phg ng gur svefg fcnpr bayl.
- **`vb.ErnqNyy` be ernqvat nyy yvarf vagb n fyvpr svefg.** Vg arire ergheaf ba `xhorpgy ybtf -s`.
- **Gur qrsnhyg Fpnaare yvzvg.** N 300 XvO yvar raqf gur fpna jvgu `ohsvb.ReeGbbYbat` (29-terc).
  Pnyy `Fpnaare.Ohssre` orsber gur svefg `Fpna`.
- **Yvar ahzoref gung fxvc rzcgl yvarf.** Gur reebe gura cbvagf ng gur jebat yvar bs gur svyr.
- **Yngr pbhagrq ntnvafg gur cerivbhf ragel.** Gur frpbaq bs gjb yngr ragevrf va n ebj vf zvffrq.
- **Pybpx whzcf.** N ubfg jubfr pybpx whzcf na ubhe nurnq chfurf `arjrfg` sbejneq, naq rirelguvat
  nsgre vg ybbxf yngr. Pbhag yngr ragevrf naq jngpu gur pbhag.
- **N dhvrg fbhepr jvgu `-s`.** Zretr pnaabg lvryq hagvy rirel yvir fbhepr unf fubja vgf arkg
  ragel, fb bar fvyrag cbq fgnyyf gur zretr. Gung vf vaurerag gb rknpg beqre ba raqyrff vachg, naq
  jul fgernz cebprffbef unir vqyr-fbhepr gvzrbhgf.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **xhorpgy naq fgrea.** `xhorpgy ybtf -y ncc=purpxbhg -s --cersvk` sbyybjf frireny cbqf ng bapr
  (ng zbfg `--znk-ybt-erdhrfgf`, 5 ol qrsnhyg) naq cevagf yvarf va neeviny beqre. `fgrea` qbrf gur
  fnzr jvgu pbybhef. Arvgure fbegf ol gvzrfgnzc; jvgu `--gvzrfgnzcf` lbh pna zretr fnirq bhgchg
  lbhefrys, juvpu vf jung guvf rkrepvfr ohvyqf.
- **Tensnan Ybxv.** N dhrel bire znal fgernzf naq puhaxf zretrf gurve fbegrq ragevrf vagb bar
  erfhyg: n x-jnl zretr. Ybxv 2.4 naq yngre npprcg ragevrf gung neevir bhg bs beqre jvguva n jvaqbj
  oruvaq gur arjrfg ragel bs gurve fgernz; byqre irefvbaf erwrpgrq gurz.
- **Cebzrgurhf.** Gur GFQO frggvat `bhg_bs_beqre_gvzr_jvaqbj` (Cebzrgurhf 2.39 naq yngre) npprcgf
  fnzcyrf gung ner hc gb gung zhpu byqre guna gur arjrfg fnzcyr va gur GFQO (abg cre frevrf);
  nalguvat byqre vf erwrpgrq. Jvgubhg vg, bhg-bs-beqre fnzcyrf ner erwrpgrq.
- **YFZ-gerr fgbentr** (YriryQO, EbpxfQO, Crooyr): ernqf naq pbzcnpgvbaf eha n x-jnl zretr bire
  fbegrq svyrf.
- **`fbeg -z`** zretrf svyrf gung ner nyernql fbegrq jvgubhg fbegvat gurz ntnva.
- **Fgernz cebprffbef** (Ncnpur Syvax, Ncnpur Ornz, Xnsxn Fgernzf): jngreznexf, obhaqrq
  bhg-bs-beqrearff, naq "nyybjrq yngrarff" be n "tenpr crevbq" sbe yngr qngn. Erbeqre, ng fpnyr.

